# Staff maintenance pages. Run with --rust-session. Signed-in cases are warm, so the oracle does not send the persona
# to its landing page, and carry ?scscpq_wp=1 because the warm-up request leaves the PHP session in WordPress mode.
# POST bodies carry the persona session's CSRF token, which the PHP ignores. Every account shown or edited is a persona.
